WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
In the Files app, long-press the file
and tap Share.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.800
In the list of apps, choose Linkalia.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:19.800
Open the category where you want to save it
and tap “Save here”.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:24.067
Done: the PDF is in your collection
and opens offline too.

